h again. Quite frankly, Minister, I cannot find it. I hope you will speak to the amendments that I am about to put and perhaps give us some tangible reasons as to why you are intending, as I believe yo","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-1657","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2009-06-16/1"}
